<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
    color:#1e293b;
    background:#ffffff;
  }

  .page{
    max-width:600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:50px 40px 30px;
  }

  /* Logo */
  .logo-wrap{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .logo-icon{
    width:64px;
    height:64px;
    margin:0 auto 8px;
    display:block;
    object-fit:contain;
  }
  .logo-name{
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .logo-name .meu{ color:#2563eb; }
  .logo-name .exame{ color:#16a34a; }

  /* Header text */
  .tag{
    text-align:center;
    color:#2563eb;
    font-size:11.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    margin:18px 0 6px;
  }
  h1{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:26px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin:0 0 8px;
    color:#0f172a;
  }
  .subhead{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:#64748b;
    margin:0 0 26px;
  }

  /* Cliente / data */
  .info-table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .info-table td{
    background:#f1f5f9;
    padding:14px 18px;
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:#64748b;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    vertical-align:top;
  }
  .info-table td:first-child{ width:65%; }
  .info-table .value{
    display:block;
    margin-top:5px;
    font-size:14.5px;
    color:#0f172a;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:normal;
  }

  /* Exames */
  .exam-header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    border-bottom:1.5px solid #2563eb;
    padding-bottom:8px;
    margin-bottom:2px;
  }
  .exam-header span{
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:#64748b;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }

  table.exams{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    font-size:13.5px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  table.exams td{
    padding:13px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  table.exams td.valor{
    text-align:right;
    width:100px;
  }
  table.exams tr.total td{
    border-bottom:none;
    padding-top:16px;
    font-weight:700;
  }

  /* Selo confirmado */
  .selo{
    background:#f0fdf4;
    border:1px solid #bbf7d0;
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:16px;
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .selo-titulo{
    color:#16a34a;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    margin:0 0 4px;
  }
  .selo-sub{
    color:#4b6156;
    font-size:11.5px;
    margin:0;
  }

  /* Local da coleta */
  .local-label{
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:#64748b;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .local-nome{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:2px;
    color:#0f172a;
  }
  .local-endereco{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:#64748b;
  }

  .disclaimer{
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:#94a3b8;
    margin-top:22px;
  }

  .footer{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:10px;
    color:#94a3b8;
    border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding-top:16px;
    margin-top:40px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="logo-wrap">
    <img class="logo-icon" src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="MeuExame">
    <div class="logo-name"><span class="meu">Meu</span><span class="exame">Exame</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tag">CONFIRMAÇÃO DE PAGAMENTO</div>
  <h1>Liberação para coleta</h1>
  <p class="subhead">Apresente este documento no atendimento do laboratório de apoio.</p>

  <table class="info-table">
    <tr>
      <td>CLIENTE<span class="value">{{ cliente }}</span></td>
      <td>DATA<span class="value">{{ data }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="exam-header">
    <span>EXAMES LIBERADOS</span>
  </div>
  <table class="exams">
    {{#each exames}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ this.nome }}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/each}}
    <tr class="total">
      <td>Total pago</td>
      <td class="valor">R$ {{ totalFormatado }}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="selo">
    <p class="selo-titulo">PAGAMENTO CONFIRMADO</p>
    <p class="selo-sub">Coleta liberada para os exames descritos acima.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="local-label">LOCAL DA COLETA</div>
  <div class="local-nome">DNA Center</div>

  <p class="disclaimer">Pagamento confirmado pelo Meu Exame. Documento emitido eletronicamente para liberação da coleta.</p>

  <div class="footer">MEU EXAME | Confirmação de pagamento e liberação para coleta</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
